-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SCOPE

This dedication covers the DATA in this repository: the station records, the
schema, the index and the generated playlists.

It does NOT cover the audio streams the URLs point at. Those are operated by
third-party broadcasters, are not ours to license, and may be geo-blocked,
rate-limited, moved or withdrawn at any time. A "verified" date means the
stream answered with audio on that day. It is not a grant of any right to
rebroadcast it.

Station discovery comes from Radio Browser (https://www.radio-browser.info),
whose collected data its author placed in the public domain.
